\import{fdip-macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}
\tag{fdip}
\taxon{Discussion}
\title{Which link is seen by the two scalars?}
\date{2026-11-19}

\p{On a single sign edge, suppose the head scalar is negative and
the source scalar is positive. Flipping the head makes both positive
and reverses the link. Which combination of the original three signs
records the new link? If two different rotations give the same scalar,
what choice is involved in such a change of variables?}
